## Key Features of the System

This comprehensive system includes:

1. **Arabic RTL Interface** - Full Arabic support with right-to-left layout
2. **11 Professional Sheets** - Dashboard, Settings, Customers, Suppliers, Products, Sales, Purchases, Inventory, Payments, Expenses, Reports
3. **Data Validation** - Dropdown lists, input restrictions, error prevention
4. **Automated Calculations** - Tax, totals, inventory tracking
5. **Conditional Formatting** - Low stock alerts, visual indicators
6. **Security** - Password protection, sheet protection
7. **Professional Formatting** - Consistent colors, fonts, borders
8. **Scalable Architecture** - Easily extendable for additional features
9. **Separate Arabic Text File** - All Arabic content in one maintainable file
10. **Business-Ready** - Suitable for real-world commercial use

The system is production-ready and can be customized for specific business requirements across all GCC countries and Egypt.